Package: boxoffice
Type: Package
Title: Scrape Box Office Data and Project Theatrical Runs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Pete", "Olsen",
      email = "pete@example.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Scrape daily box office data from Box Office Mojo and The Numbers
    for films released from 1980 to present. Build predictive models to project
    full theatrical runs based on opening performance, including total domestic
    gross and day-by-day trajectory forecasts.
